    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a UV-4 (200 µm) nozzle along a 26193 µm G-code path at 52.42 mm/min to fill a 45157 µm footprint at 666 µm line pitch, and report deposition rate, extruded volume, print time, filament mass and fill-line count.",
